1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
I didn't draw a single line of this guy.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,200
No Figma.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,200
No designer.

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,200
Zero dollars.

5
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,600
Just Claude Opus 5.5.

6
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,040
And it took four tries.

7
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,040
Try one.

8
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,520
A cute 3D toy version of me.

9
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:11,520
Nope.

10
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,520
Too cute.

11
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:13,520
Try two.

12
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,520
Realistic character sheets.

13
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:15,520
Looked great.

14
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:17,200
Then my free chat GPT limit ran out.

15
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,200
Try three.

16
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,920
Claude cut me out of those tiny images, blurriages, and my shoes.

17
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,920
Just gone.

18
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,400
So Claude said, the images aren't the problem, the method is, and rebuilt me

19
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,400
from scratch.

20
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:31,880
And code, 600 lines, real joints, elbows that bend on their own.

21
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,280
He breathes, he shifts his weight, he lip syncs to my voice.

22
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,280
Try four.

23
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,920
This is the one talking to you right now.

24
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,080
Follow, and watch what he does next.

25
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,360
And no, I still haven't drawn a single line.
